{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a futuristic world, an alien conglomerate has established its base on the far side of the moon, with the goal of infiltrating Earth's civilization and dominating humanity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earth sends a protagonist undercover into the alien corporation to act as a spy within the extraterrestrial enterprise. The mission includes gathering intelligence, tampering with data, attending meetings, deceiving colleagues, and most importantly... choosing the right side.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3959460/extras/ed536288fd3bb885d22ac2c35391c454.avif?t=1760867075\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3959460/extras_big/ed536288fd3bb885d22ac2c35391c454.avif?t=1760867075 width=1560 height=504 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25a0 Side-Scrolling Pixel RPG Exploration<br>Explore multiple maps such as the alien company\u2019s lobby, cafeteria, workstations, employee bedrooms, and the CEO\u2019s office.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3959460/extras/c94c730992171c0fd61a09743108f6a6.avif?t=1760867075\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25a0 Visual Novel<br>Collect intelligence throughout the game to unlock numerous finely designed pixel scenes and engaging storylines.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3959460/extras/1ef5a8bc56cedf064973e111970b230b.avif?t=1760867075\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25a0 Dialogue Game<br>Make different choices during company meetings to trigger various endings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3959460/extras/ee5dbf7bc935fe923685e2a8dff665f9.avif?t=1760867075\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25a0 Cyberpunk Dark Comedy Story<br>Immerse yourself in richly detailed pixel animations and atmospheric cyberpunk trap music.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3959460/extras/e6222674d0937de8e684eca38b4ccbc4.avif?t=1760867075\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3959460?t=1760867075","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3959460/9a5aa5d407b9a77bb3689c7b8af82d85526c224b/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1760867075","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3959460/a17a4b804a9ba345474ba13b24ae5ec4023030c9/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760867075","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3959460/a17a4b804a9ba345474ba13b24ae5ec4023030c9/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760867075","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":4049120,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a futuristic world, an alien conglomerate has established its base on the far side of the moon, with the goal of infiltrating Earth's civilization and dominating humanity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earth sends a protagonist undercover into the alien corporation to act as a spy within the extraterrestrial enterprise. The mission includes gathering intelligence, tampering with data, attending meetings, deceiving colleagues, and most importantly... choosing the right side.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"b